---
id: ingestion.fetch_document.type_selection
description: User-facing message asking which document type is being ingested (interactive /learn flow). Not an LLM prompt — sent verbatim to the user.
owner: ops
component: orchestrator_experts
overridable: true
output: text
sections: []
variables: []
access:
  view: [ops, eng]
  edit: [ops]
  publish: [ops]
---
What type of document are you adding?

1. Support Example (customer interaction, chat transcript)
2. Technical (specs, architecture, implementation guide)
3. SOP (standard operating procedure, checklist)
4. FAQ (frequently asked questions)
5. Policy (company rules, guidelines)

Reply with a number (1-5), or `cancel` to abort.
